    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aed4f26b4a4e20202f59aa3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>什么是「意图电商」？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a></span></strong><span>AI直接卖广告位不香吗？为什么还需要GEO服务商？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a></span></strong><span>AI竞价广告，其实违背了AI发展的底层规律</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a></span></strong><span>AI时代的商业化，不该再赚「谁花钱多谁露脸」的钱</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a></span></strong><span>现在国内绝大多数的GEO做法，其实都是错的</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a></span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>AI不推荐你，你就赛博逝世了</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">29:48</a></span></strong><span>当下大部分GEO公司在用二踢脚技术造火箭</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a></span></strong><span>AI时代的流量平权</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2278">37:58</a></span></strong><span>未来GEO会吃掉所有传统营销动作</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2765">46:05</a></span></strong><span>做GEO到底要花多少钱？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3203">53:23</a></span></strong><span>小红书、大众点评，在AI时代会被替代吗？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3935">01:05:35</a></span></strong><span>商业化第一年做近亿营收，GEO赛道真的爆发了</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4054">01:07:34</a></span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>AI真的会替代人吗？别把自己活成「牛马」</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/665843b5ad5aa5d8c272fe3b/lhUMP8-HTxgTth36hWk0_jCCOd30.m4a" length="69703903" type="audio/mp4"/>
