    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa2735d9d32647781670e6e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 小店到底是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a>其实咖啡店是可以赚钱的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1188">19:48</a> 开店三件套：算账、勤奋、情绪稳定</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1389">23:09</a> 好好开店，不搞加盟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> FINE的热血日剧开局：76块钱的早餐，4000人抢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">33:11</a> 爸妈借的40万，开出五六千万的盘子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2321">38:41</a> 咖啡、松饼、泰餐、川菜，凭啥个个开花</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2767">46:07</a> 2026年开啥店</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3049">50:49</a> 人情味是椅子高度，回购是客人的人生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3364">56:04</a> 60%员工跟了六年，我吹的牛逼都圆上了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3934">01:05:34</a> 十年开店0个微信群</span></p>]]></description>
