  <item>
    <title>Vol.93 单品卖出15亿锋味派合伙人于晓楠，曾任英皇首席助理，IP + 产品 + 渠道的系统化商业的组合拳怎么打？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a9129bfa0210c197dc987d4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a9129bfa0210c197dc987d4</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a>统治 80/90后青春的英皇娱乐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a>拆解英皇造星，把细节打磨到骨子里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a>四线城市女孩，如何成为杨老板最信任的助理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a>什么是职场不可替代的能力？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a>一手操办十年英皇年会，把香港业务落地内地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">31:38</a>和谢霆锋从老同事到一起创业做锋味派</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a> IP + 产品 + 渠道协同，找对团队才能盘活生意</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3015">50:15</a>从美学原点再出发，创立 IVN 美学品牌</span></p>]]></description>
