    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5b01f56356eb2d9be471b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a>一张 “纸片子” 值一个亿？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a>卡牌市场95% 都是凑热闹，消费级和收藏级根本不是一回事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a>稀缺性是怎么被设计出来的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="524">08:44</a>卡牌二级市场是线上平台 + 线下卡展双向变现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a>月薪五千可以玩卡牌吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a>签约中国国漫IP凡人修仙传</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a>周星驰大话西游独家签名卡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a>还有哪些 IP 能跑出下一个宝可梦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a>不和巨头卷数量，要做中国本土的收藏级 IP</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1999">33:19</a>00后四次创业，要先做事，不是先赚钱</span></p>]]></description>
