    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2">00:02</a> 本想我的人生挂满勋章，最后只剩一条破围裙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 35 岁一无所有转行，赌一次创业机会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> 借设备、买廉价烤盘，靠看书自学做面包</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 摆摊第一天只卖36元，却给了我希望</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 家人嫌我不体面，老公三个月不和我说话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> 坚决不炒网红高价面包</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">16:29</a> 摆地摊练出的超强执行力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a>疫情捐了2w+面包</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">20:09</a> 卖不出去我就赔钱送</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1571">26:11</a> 珍藏创业小账本，从日入 36 到日卖 2000 个</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 不追女性标签，我只想做好面包</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
